  ('h2','Step 3: check the details'),
  ('ul',['Where to send the application, and in what file type','Closing date and any reference number to quote','Whether a visa, walk-in or interview date is mentioned']),
  ('h2','Step 4: reply the right way'),
  ('p','Put the job title or reference in the email subject. Write two short lines in the email, attach your CV, and keep your phone on.'),
